    "chunk_text": "Se \u00e6\u00f0ele \u00feeode Lar\u00f0eaw, he foresette on \u00fereo wisen ure sawlen neod\u00f0earflice, \u00fe\u00e6t is hyht & Ne sceal nan mann, \u00feeh he seo ofsett mid ungem\u00e6ttre byrdene his synnen, geortreowigen beo \u00fe\u00e6re For \u00fean hyhte \u00fe\u00e6re forgeofonysse we ne sculen singallice synegian, for \u00fean \u00fee God swy\u00f0e rihtlice \u00fea Swa eac on \u00e6lces geswynces nearenysse us is to gernene to \u00fe\u00e6re uplicen \u00e6rf\u00e6stnysse fultumes, for \u00fean De scripturarum lectione Seo r\u00e6ding haligre gewritan is oncnawenysse \u00fe\u00e6re ecen eadignysse. On \u00fean halgen gewriten se mann hine sylfne m\u00e6ig sceawigen swa swa on hwylcen sceawere, hwylc he Seo singale r\u00e6ding haligre gewriten, heo cl\u00e6nsa\u00f0 \u00fea sawle \u00fe\u00e6s r\u00e6dendan, heo gebrinc\u00f0 on his mode Se \u00fee wyle simle mid Gode beon, he sceal him oft gebiddan, & he sceal oft halige gewriten r\u00e6dan, for Seo halige r\u00e6ding twifealde gyfe heo brinc\u00f0 \u00fean r\u00e6dindan. \u00c6rest heo l\u00e6r\u00f0 his modes andgit, \u00fe\u00e6t hit \u00fea scearpere by\u00f0, & eac \u00fe\u00e6t heo fram \u00feysses middeneardes Seo r\u00e6ding haligre gewritan is swy\u00f0e arf\u00e6stlic weorc, & heo swy\u00f0e help\u00f0 to sawlen gecl\u00e6nsunge. Gelice heo & se lichame by\u00f0 gefeded mid fl\u00e6sclicen meten, swa eac se innre mann, \u00fe\u00e6t is seo sawle, Se by\u00f0 swy\u00f0e ges\u00e6lig, se \u00fee \u00fea halge gewriten",
